==Icelandic==

=== Alternative spellings ===
* [[alls staðar]]

=== Etymology ===
A contraction of {{term|alls staðar||of all place|lang=is}} from {{term|alls||of all|lang=is}} the genitive of {{term|allur||all|lang=is}} and {{term|staðar||of a place|lang=is}} the genitive of {{term|staður||a place|lang=is}}.

=== Adverb ===
{{infl|is|adverb}}

